---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /review/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: Review mode
kicker: AI in Data Science · for course staff
standfirst: >
  Leave comments and suggested edits directly on the course pages, then send your review
  file to the author.
description: Comment on and suggest edits to the course pages.
---
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/review/review.css' | url }}">

<div class="rv-panel" data-review-panel>

<p>Turn review mode on, then read the course as usual. Select any text to leave a comment or
suggest a rewording. Each activity has a button for comments on the activity as a whole.
Your comments are saved in this browser as you go. When you're done, download your review
file and send it to the author.</p>

<section class="rv-group">
  <h2>You</h2>
  <label class="rv-field">Your name
    <input id="rv-name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Shown next to your comments">
  </label>
  <div class="rv-row">
    <button id="rv-toggle" class="rv-btn primary" type="button">Turn on review mode</button>
    <span id="rv-state" class="rv-help"></span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rv-group">
  <h2>Where comments are saved</h2>
  <label class="rv-choice"><input type="radio" name="rv-mode" value="local" checked> This browser only.
    Download your review file to share it.</label>
  <label class="rv-choice"><input type="radio" name="rv-mode" value="sync" disabled> Shared server.
    Everyone with the passcode sees each other's comments as they're made.</label>
  <div id="rv-sync" class="rv-sync" hidden>
    <label class="rv-field">Server address <input id="rv-server" type="url" placeholder="https://…"></label>
    <label class="rv-field">Passcode <input id="rv-passcode" type="password" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <div class="rv-row">
      <button id="rv-test" class="rv-btn" type="button">Test connection</button>
      <span id="rv-test-result" class="rv-help"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rv-group">
  <h2>Review files</h2>
  <div class="rv-row">
    <button id="rv-download" class="rv-btn primary" type="button">Download my review</button>
    <span id="rv-unexported" class="rv-help"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="rv-row">
    <label class="rv-btn" for="rv-files">Load review files…</label>
    <input id="rv-files" class="rv-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" multiple>
    <span id="rv-load-result" class="rv-help" role="status"></span>
  </div>
  <p class="rv-help">Loading other people's files shows their comments alongside yours, on every
  page. They're never added to your own download. You can pick several files at once.</p>
  <div class="rv-row">
    <button id="rv-clear-loaded" class="rv-btn" type="button">Clear loaded reviews</button>
    <button id="rv-clear-mine" class="rv-btn danger" type="button">Delete my comments</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rv-group">
  <h2>All comments</h2>
  <div id="rv-filter" class="rv-chips"></div>
  <div id="rv-table"></div>
</section>

</div>

<script type="module" src="{{ '/assets/review/page.js' | url }}"></script>
